From 38347ac7330df61600baaa8ea5286445a24f73e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/63] include: the podkop_slim and podkop_full sets of
 protocols and services

What a podkop-engine build registers: podkop_slim keeps the protocols podkop writes and drops the
rest (snell, the API service, resolved), podkop_full adds every outbound; the http outbound stays in
both.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  52d48b51c include: podkop_slim build tag drops snell and the API service
  5493d9451 include: drop the resolved service and DNS transport
  7f425dbfc include: podkop_slim keeps podkop's protocols, podkop_full adds every outbound
  d4a94c067 include: the http outbound in podkop-engine, not only in podkop-engine-full

Pdk-Feature: build-slim
Pdk-Zone: other
Pdk-Layer: 00
